                ^"Effects" LIST ["Instantly transport the target to anything within range associated with one of the caster’s Sympathy Traits.", "Prevent the target from traveling out of the range of the effect, as determined when the rite is cast. For example, a Range: Touch effect would prevent the target from moving from the spot where the caster performed the rite, even if the caster leaves the area."]
                ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
            }
        }

