                ^"Effects" LIST ["Give the target a bonus to Recovery rolls and a penalty to Aging rolls, or a bonus to Aging rolls and a penalty to Recovery rolls, equal to ((3 + magnitude) x 3) as long as this effect is active for at least half of the time period. This Recovery penalty does not cause wounds to worsen, though it does prevent them from healing normally."]
