                ^"Effects" LIST ["Give the target a +1 bonus to Recovery rolls and a +1 penalty to Aging rolls, or a –1 bonus to Aging rolls and a –1 penalty to Recovery rolls.", "Reduce a physically mature target’s apparent age by one year for the duration. Each additional magnitude removes another year. (Ritual)"]
                ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
